## Required signals

- Azure Activity Log and resource health.
- Entra workload-identity sign-ins and authentication failures.
- Policy compliance and exemption expiry.
- Terraform plan/apply outcomes by layer.
- State lock, version, and backend failures.
- Firewall, NSG flow, private endpoint, and DNS health.
- Backup job, restore-point, and vault immutability status.
- Budget, forecast, and anomalous-cost events.

## Alert routing

Action-group recipients are sourced from
`observability.alerting.actionGroupEmails`. Empty recipients must be resolved
before production. Alerts must identify severity, affected layer and
subscription, runbook, owning team, correlation identifier, and escalation
path.

